B.a3d=new A.aP('We hail thee our dear KGSS\nThe fount of wisdom and our well being\nTo thee we vow to keep up your banner\nAnd everywhere make krobo shine\n\nWith the help of the Almighty\nWe\u2019ll work hard to place high your fame\nAnd lead us to our motto "the best for the highest"\nKrobo will shine\n\nWith the help of the Almighty\nWe\u2019ll work hard to place high your fame\nAnd lead us to our motto "the best for the highest"\nKrobo is shining \u2026\u2026\u2026.YES !!!',null,B.Dv,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
